Group project for the machine learning course at Carnegie Mellon University

Classification of patients into esophageal cancer subtypes
• Implemented machine learning models- random forests, support vector machines, and logistic regression
• Applied it to the TCGA dataset on esophageal cancer to classify patients into cancer subtypes based on miRNA-seq data
• Evaluated the performances of the above models and accomplished a 0.97 test F1 score using the random forest
classifier
